      "text": "Your Highness, we have a guest♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 6.5,
      "end_time": 8.6,
      "text": "Lind, Wurm"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 9.0,
      "end_time": 10.4,
      "text": "Good work for today"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 12.2,
      "end_time": 15.1,
      "text": "Croce. And those people are...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 16.6,
      "end_time": 18.9,
      "text": "Hey there♪ I'm Pecorine!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 19.2,
      "end_time": 20.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 20.5,
      "end_time": 24.1,
      "text": "Sigh, this is a Castle of Parfait's throne, you know?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 24.3,
      "end_time": 28.0,
      "text": "It is no good to bring in suspicious people."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 28.3,
      "end_time": 31.2,
      "text": "Ahaha, don't worry, Lind!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 31.5,
      "end_time": 33.4,
      "text": "There's nothing suspicious about them!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 33.6,
      "end_time": 36.3,
      "text": "But a lot has happened recently..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 37.1,
      "end_time": 40.4,
      "text": "Haaa.. Aneki, don't you think you're worrying too much?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 40.6,
      "end_time": 42.2,
      "text": "Wait, even Wurm-!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 45.3,
      "end_time": 47.6,
      "text": "Well, are you a guest?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 65.3,
      "end_time": 66.5,
      "text": "Nice to meet you♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 67.5,
      "end_time": 70.2,
      "text": "I am Lyrael"
    }
